{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47432","headline":"送卧云道士 · 虞有贤","name":"送卧云道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧云道士来相辞，相辞倏忽何所之。\n紫阁春深烟霭霭，东风花柳折枝枝。\n药成酒熟有时节，寒食恐失松间期。\n冥鸿一见伤弓翼，高飞展转心无疑。\n满酌数杯酒，狂吟几首诗。\n留不住，去不悲，醯鸡蜉蝣安得知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞有贤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}